    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE NIMAL RUPASINGHE FRIENDSHIPFOUNDATION",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      240.41,
      401.89,
      313.79
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS an society called and known as the \u201cNimalRupasinghe Friendship Foundation\u201d has heretofore beenformed in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carryingout its objects and transacting all matters connected with thesaid Foundation according to the rules agreed to by itsmembers:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      327.17,
      401.9,
      388.19
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      401.57,
      401.91,
      425.27
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      438.77,
      401.88,
      462.47
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Nimal RupasingheFriendship Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      475.97,
      401.9,
      574.07
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so may persons as now are members of the NimalRupasinghe Friendship Foundation (hereinafter referred to asthe \u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereinafter be admitted as membersof the \u201cNimal Rupasinghe Friendship Foundation\u201d(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) and by thatname may sue and be sued with full power and authority to haveand use a common seal and to alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      587.57,
      401.87,
      611.27
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      174.57,
      624.77,
      401.88,
      673.31
    ],
    "text": "(a) To implement programmes and to give guidance tocreate a good atmosphere to build up peace andharmony in all communities and ethnic groups tolive as Sri Lankans;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      440.71,
      443.86,
      449.78
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
